pageType: content
background:
  type: image
  src: "media/template-inner.png"
  fit: {mode: cover}
elements:
  - elementId: title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [58, 44, 820, 48]
    content:
      style: "$title"
      text: 案例三验收｜高并发读取与数据完整性同时满足
  - elementId: lead
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 100, 840, 30]
    content:
      style: "$subtitle"
      text: 验收同时覆盖查询规模、聚合覆盖、明细分页、降级来源和结果准确性。
  - elementId: c1
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [60, 158, 250, 174]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$pale"}
    border: {style: solid, width: 1, color: "$red"}
  - elementId: c1t
    elementType: text
    bounds: [78, 180, 214, 132]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      text: |
        <p><strong>读取性能</strong></p>
        <p>按 Tab 返回 summary、timeline、维度排名与明细，避免无关数据重复传输。</p>
        <p>明细独立 keyset 分页。</p>
  - elementId: c2
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [355, 158, 250, 174]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$pale"}
    border: {style: solid, width: 1, color: "$blue"}
  - elementId: c2t
    elementType: text
    bounds: [373, 180, 214, 132]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      text: |
        <p><strong>聚合完整性</strong></p>
        <p>Rollup 失败时水位不前移；晚到事件进入 raw tail；聚合可删除后重建。</p>
  - elementId: c3
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [650, 158, 250, 174]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$pale"}
    border: {style: solid, width: 1, color: "$red"}
  - elementId: c3t
    elementType: text
    bounds: [668, 180, 214, 132]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      text: |
        <p><strong>解释能力</strong></p>
        <p>当筛选或日期范围超出 Rollup 覆盖时，返回 raw fallback 及 source / complete 元数据。</p>
  - elementId: rule
    elementType: line
    bounds: [60, 372, 840, 1]
    viewBox: [840, 1]
    points: "0,0 840,0"
    border: {style: solid, width: 1, color: "$line"}
  - elementId: bottom
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 402, 840, 62]
    content:
      fontSize: 21
      bold: true
      color: "$ink"
      text: 验收结论：分析结果兼顾性能、准确性和来源可解释性，避免静默少统计。
